            "Find it with Google\u2019s Place ID finder: search for your business and copy the ID.": [
                "Tal\u00e1lja meg a Google Helyazonos\u00edt\u00f3-keres\u0151j\u00e9vel: keressen r\u00e1 v\u00e1llalkoz\u00e1s\u00e1ra, \u00e9s m\u00e1solja ki az azonos\u00edt\u00f3t."
