            "An API key from your Google Cloud project with the Places API (New) enabled. Restrict it to that API.": [
                "Egy API-kulcs a Google Cloud projektj\u00e9b\u0151l, amelyen enged\u00e9lyezve van a Places API (New). Korl\u00e1tozza azt kiz\u00e1r\u00f3lag erre az API-ra."
