            "The 24-character ID of your business on Trustpilot, from your Trustpilot Business account (Integrations \u203a API).": [
                "A v\u00e1llalkoz\u00e1sod 24 karakteres azonos\u00edt\u00f3ja a Trustpilot oldalon, a Trustpilot Business fi\u00f3kodb\u00f3l (Integrations \u203a API)."
            ],
            "The API key of your Trustpilot Business account.": [
                "A Trustpilot Business fi\u00f3kja API-kulcsa."
            ],
            "Not set up.": [
                "Nincs be\u00e1ll\u00edtva."
            ],
            "The saved key can no longer be read (the site\u2019s security keys changed). Enter it again.": [
                "A mentett kulcs m\u00e1r nem olvashat\u00f3 (a webhely biztons\u00e1gi kulcsai megv\u00e1ltoztak). Adja meg \u00fajra."
            ],
            "Needs both an ID and an API key.": [
                "Sz\u00fcks\u00e9ges hozz\u00e1 egy azonos\u00edt\u00f3 \u00e9s egy API-kulcs is."
            ],
            "Set up. Google reviews are loaded live each time a page with a Reviews block is viewed: one Place Details request on your own key per view, never stored (Google\u2019s terms do not allow keeping them).": [
                "Be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s. A Google-v\u00e9lem\u00e9nyek k\u00f6zvetlen\u00fcl bet\u00f6lt\u0151dnek minden alkalommal, amikor megtekintenek egy V\u00e9lem\u00e9nyek blokkot tartalmaz\u00f3 oldalt: oldalank\u00e9nt egy Place Details k\u00e9r\u00e9s a saj\u00e1t kulccsal, soha nincs t\u00e1rolva (a Google felt\u00e9telei nem engedik meg a meg\u0151rz\u00e9s\u00fcket)."
            ],
            "The first refresh failed: %s": [
                "Az els\u0151 friss\u00edt\u00e9s nem siker\u00fclt: %s"
            ],
            "Waiting for the first refresh (within a minute or two).": [
                "V\u00e1rakoz\u00e1s az els\u0151 friss\u00edt\u00e9sre (egy-k\u00e9t percen bel\u00fcl)."
            ],
            "Refreshed %1$s: %2$d reviews kept, rated %3$s from %4$d.": [
                "Friss\u00edtve %1$s: %2$d \u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9s megtartva, \u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9se %3$s %4$d-b\u0151l."
            ],
            "The last try, %1$s, failed and the reviews above were kept: %2$s": [
                "Az utols\u00f3 pr\u00f3b\u00e1lkoz\u00e1s (%1$s) sikertelen volt, \u00e9s a fenti \u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9sek megmaradtak: %2$s"
            ],
            "Saved. Trustpilot reviews are fetched in the background within a minute or two; Google reviews load live on the page.": [
                "Mentve. A Trustpilot v\u00e9lem\u00e9nyek a h\u00e1tt\u00e9rben t\u00f6lt\u0151dnek be egy-k\u00e9t percen bel\u00fcl; a Google v\u00e9lem\u00e9nyek \u00e9l\u0151ben jelennek meg az oldalon."
            ],
            "Trustpilot reviews are fetched once a day in the background and kept on your site, so a busy page costs nothing extra on your Trustpilot account; if a refresh fails, the last reviews stay. Google does not allow its reviews to be stored, so they are loaded live when a visitor views the page: each view is one request on your own Google key, billed by Google.": [
                "A Trustpilot-v\u00e9lem\u00e9nyek lek\u00e9r\u00e9se a h\u00e1tt\u00e9rben naponta egyszer t\u00f6rt\u00e9nik, \u00e9s a webhelyen marad, \u00edgy a forgalmas oldalak sem terhelik t\u00fal a Trustpilot-fi\u00f3kj\u00e1t; ha a friss\u00edt\u00e9s nem siker\u00fcl, az utols\u00f3 v\u00e9lem\u00e9nyek megmaradnak. A Google nem enged\u00e9lyezi az \u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9seinek t\u00e1rol\u00e1s\u00e1t, ez\u00e9rt azok \u00e9l\u0151ben t\u00f6lt\u0151dnek be, amikor egy l\u00e1togat\u00f3 megtekinti az oldalt: minden megtekint\u00e9s egy k\u00e9r\u00e9s a saj\u00e1t Google-kulcs\u00e1n, amelyet a Google sz\u00e1ml\u00e1z ki."
            ],
            "Where to find it": [
                "Hol tal\u00e1lhat\u00f3"
